{"version":1,"content":"<p><strong>黃仁勳已大方承認自己的出軌行為，按照英偉達官方的最新安排，他目前仍然會繼續擔任公司CEO職務。黃仁勳在公開信裏直白坦言，自己欠家人和所有相關方一個鄭重的道歉。</strong>他對妻子不忠，相關行為實實在在傷害了伴侶和孩子，他做的事沒有任何可以用來開脱的藉口，對此深感愧疚。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585766.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.083743+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T07:11:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"3d079a014b7a393b9d35e0a479cd7a4c3f4945cb01f55d6766cdfc75abf4f72b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}